  <section class="section"><div class="prose">
    <p>SDAHC Research is the market intelligence arm of SDA Home Choices. We publish independent analysis of Australia's Specialist Disability Accommodation sector, combining public NDIS data with proprietary transaction data to give investors a clear view of demand, vacancy risk, and exit liquidity across every state and territory.</p>

    <h2>SDA Market Report 2026</h2>
    <p>Our flagship annual report is a 76-page analysis of Australia's SDA market: state-by-state commentary across all eight jurisdictions, new-build delivery and pipeline, value-for-money benchmarks, participant and sales data, and SDAHC's proprietary Market Assessment Framework. Built for investors who need to understand demand, vacancy exposure, and exit liquidity, not just new supply.</p>
    <p><a class="btn b1" href="/research/sda-market-report-2026/">Access the report</a></p>

